{"id":"aarudra","name":"Aarudra Kabaaleeswarar Temple","category":"Temples","location":"Fort area, Erode","description":"A historic Shiva shrine in Erode’s old Fort area, also known as Arudra Kabaleeswarar Temple.","tagline":"In the heart of old Erode","note":"Look for the Erode Fort temple when navigating, not Chennai’s similarly named temple.","source":"https://erode.nic.in/religious-tourism/","image":"/__l5e/assets-v1/1c6cd5b7-e29b-4b18-9943-c9236dbde240/erode-aarudra-gopuram.jpg","mapQuery":"Aarudra Kabaaleeswarar Temple, Fort area, Erode, Tamil Nadu, India","photoSource":"https://nrameshrao.wordpress.com/2018/10/27/sri-arudra-kapaleeswara-temple-erode/","photoCredit":"N. Ramesh Rao","ordinality":19},
